{"html": "<div class=\"exhbox\"><div class=\"exhhead\">⚠ 急騰後の失速（出尽くし型）（注意）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・10/30に出来高39.1倍の急騰（前日比+25.1%）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・翌営業日に続落（買いの続かなさを確認）</div><div class=\"exhwhy\">・急騰日の高値からすでに−33.5%</div><div class=\"discnote\">「材料出尽くし」＝良い発表（上方修正・増配など）で急騰した後、買いたい人が買い終わって利益確定売りに押される現象。値動きと出来高の形からの機械検知・予測であり、必ず下がるという意味ではありません。急騰直後の高値追いは一呼吸置くのが定石です。</div></div><div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:37.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">38</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:9.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-2.4σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:32.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-17.1%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:16.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">下向き</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">50/200日線</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:75.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">GC</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">支持帯の試し</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:60.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">7回目</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">20日高値から</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:13.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:53.3%; width:46.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">−33.5%</span></div><div class=\"msub\">準主要指標（補助的に見る）</div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ストキャス</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; backgroun